From 45314c685db54af326aede20cf27a66b42addba9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Dmitry Iv." <df.creative@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 00:33:33 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Replace the two local passes with watr's propagation family
 at the same point

propagateSingleUse and foldSetToTee (src/optimize/locals.js, their
tally/motion helpers, the re-export and the two flags) are deleted.
watr's propagate is the one implementation: with watr's fixpoint on it
runs there, at its own point; when the fixpoint is off (fast, watr:
false) the driver invokes it on each function at the point the two
passes held, after the vectorizer and before devirt, under the new flag
propagateLocals; a v128 function is left as emitted.

Measured over the bench corpus against 5763b63f (watr 5ff0037): size
+62 B (+0.05%, 23 of 58 cases byte-identical), speed -70 B (-0.04%, 25
identical), fast -5,082 B (-2.66%): the family forwards what the two
passes forwarded and more. Of the size/speed residue, +18/+16 B are
propagations watr now refuses for evaluation order; the rest is the
fixpoint reaching a different point without the pre-watr pass. Running
the family early with the fixpoint on was measured and rejected: the
merged guard temps hid narrow/unclamp/intguard's shapes and vm's checked
reads stayed f64-boxed, 2.2x slower; without the early run vm, dispatch,
shapes, synth, json and lz time within noise of the base (loaded
machine, alternating runs). The dispatch regression the migration was
warned about does not appear.

The optimizer test pins the flag at watr:false (the temp forwarded, the
first read a tee) and on/off bit-exactness at watr:false, level 2 and
speed over the shapes a careless propagation miscompiles, the trapping
division before a store among them. Four promoteIntArrayLiterals pins
read the storage shape instead of a local the family now forwards.

Rebased onto f43229d2: two more pins read a local the family forwards. The
feature-gating probe pin accepts the slot address as the tee propagation sinks
into the first key load; the interval-proof checked-access pin reads the guard
when the index temp is merged into the index local.
